{"server":"tw","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_02_end","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_02","title":"不對稱庭園","storyCode":"CR-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"9a80df118500a3dfdf23522cb650b3828dd1b832de4230d619082c46534b03b3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"幫助了特克諾的IANA和DOC造訪街頭藝術社區，卻被受整個社區尊敬的老消防員迪亞茲誤會。他們首次體驗社區文化的旅程不得不在躲避追捕的過程中進行。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼我能幫忙的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，剩下的就交給我的朋友，她馬上就來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一接到你的消息我馬上就過來了，你這傢伙是怎麼了？讓我看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸，你別弄我頭啦，這麼多人你注意點，別掀我裙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這不蠻好的……活蹦亂跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了這兩位，我發病的時候他們剛好在旁邊，幫了我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我是醫生，都是該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……這年頭像你一樣的醫生不多了，大多數一聽到我們的情況，跑都來不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這位小姐有人照顧，那我們就不久留了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，別走啊。這是小店的名片，你們有空務必光顧，按摩推拿一應俱全，你們來都是八折優惠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，小姐，我不是很需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們別客氣，那傢伙手藝不錯，大家有什麼感冒頭痛的都去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，身為醫生，我對自己的身體狀況大致有瞭解，很健康，不需要額外關注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，試過再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我們還是保持距離比較好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女人聽到IANA的話，退後幾步，從包裡掏出一副手套，戴好後捏了捏手指，發出清脆的咔噠聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，離你遠點也能按。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個距離你能碰到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，咳咳，我聽說過這種隔空進行的氣功療法，很多資料證實這不過是偽科……呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只見她的手指在空中輕輕捏過幾下，二人奇異地感受到一股溫熱的力量在按壓自己的肩頸，瞬間，輕鬆與舒爽將他們溫柔地包裹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……我感覺壓力和焦慮……一掃而空……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是錯覺嗎……我現在舒服得頭皮發麻……啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……誰還管什麼科學……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……你說藥被搶走了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是開玩笑的，埃內斯托先生，我們的社區裡有很多感染者，他們都需要藥物來控制病情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，是我和阿萊塔小姐沒能完成運輸任務，造成的損失我們會盡快想辦法彌補。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會想賠錢了事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果找不到，我會想辦法按時賠償你等量的藥品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，埃內斯托先生……是我太著急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些搶藥的人，你們有看到他們的樣子嗎？社區裡人多，說不定能幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我們覺得蹊蹺的地方，那些人埋伏在半途中突然衝出，似乎是早有準備。羅德島在這裡一向是小心處事，從不與人交惡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我實在想不出有什麼人會這樣針對我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許他們就是盯上了你們的藥，抑制劑在黑市的價格可不低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在搶奪過程中他們採用的戰術非常專業，動作迅速，乾淨利落……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些藥品真的值得讓一群人如此大動干戈嗎？對了，我依稀記得在躲避時還聽到了銃械的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃械……又是專業的傢伙……呵，雷內爾真瞧得起我們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞茲先生，你覺得這次行動是有人針對社區嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我們與雷內爾也是積怨很久了，只是沒想到……他最終會使用如此下流的手段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樓下發生什麼了，怎麼這麼吵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好像是有人在外面病情發作，被好心人送回來了。喲，這裡三層外三層的，圍的全都是來感謝的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們好的人，當然是要報答的。讓我看看來的是哪裡的客……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾個怎麼這麼臉熟，感覺在哪裡看過？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從桌上拿起昨天的報紙，男人草草翻過幾頁找到八卦版，看見標題上赫然寫著：《沒人能忍受他的惡劣性格——雷內爾再次更換保鏢》。\n旁邊的副標題則是《記者獨家暗訪：四名保鏢兩兩輪換，究竟何方神聖》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……這幾張照片裡的人和樓底下出現的人，是不是有些相似得過分了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，這下我們可真得好好報答報答了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像自己是完全嶄新的一個人了……這種感覺很難形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……謝謝你，這種按摩方式太神奇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是我從謝拉格學的傳統按摩術。當年我在暴風雪中登上聖山，當地的聖女看我誠心才決定將這秘術傳授給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉倒吧，你從敘拉古來這裡都有七八年了，哪裡來的時間去雪境，你們可別信啊，都是虛假廣告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你怎麼污人清白呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，謝謝您的按摩，時候不早了，我們確實也該離開——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，二位，雷內爾身邊人手眾多，缺了你們兩個辦事應該也不會怎樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不如多留一下子，讓我們好好招待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹，你這氣沖沖的是怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好意思說，你怎麼跟這群搶藥的傢伙混在一起，還把他們帶到社區來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……藥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，抑制礦石病的藥！被他們搶走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搶走？？那也不可能是他們啊！他們甚至連礦石病是什麼都不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，所謂搶藥的事情，我們真的沒頭緒，這中間是不是有誤會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誤會？雇傭兵打扮，用銃，不是黑鋼的人，這地界除了你們還有誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們只是把這女孩送回到這裡來，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真有誤會，那你們可得好好向我澄清下。來人，給我抓住他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人看見迪亞茲背後的副手舉起手中的木杖。\n儘管完全無法想像杖尖的光芒究竟會如何造成殺傷，他們還是本能地感受到了危險的逼近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑，卡提布，跑！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來啊，拿銃的混蛋！我看你們哪個敢進社區一步！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑得也太快了，我追都追不上，那兩個人現在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在那裡傻站著幹什麼？還不趕快去把那兩個人找出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲的副手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走，趕緊走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼、呼……那是什麼？魔法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是叫源石技藝的東西，就當是魔法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們得先想個辦法離開。幾個出口處都有人把守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……掩護我，我來操作雙子分身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已就位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"複製器已開啟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，他們跑到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有，那裡也沒有……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"見鬼了！她從哪冒出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的社區居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這女人怎麼敢大搖大擺出現在路中間的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"弓、弩、發射器、施術單元……亂七八糟的武器齊齊對準路中間的雙子分身。\n就算是IANA本人，透過分身的雙眼看到如此熱烈的“歡迎”，也不免愣住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，你們可真是……熱情得過頭啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弓、弩、炸彈、“魔法”……嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁著他們的注意力都在投影被打後的去向上，趕快走吧，再等一下子，他們就該回過神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許之後我們應該聯絡ELA問問，到底發生了什麼事，我現在大腦一片混亂……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不，我很確定不是雷內爾派的人，他的保全人員最近被舒瑞訓練得叫苦連天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定那傢伙的話可信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":true,"text":"確定。他今天一整天都沒機會發布這樣的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這裡的人似乎真的篤定是我們搶走了他們的藥品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那些都是其次，當務之急是趕緊離開那片社區……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":true,"text":"考慮到那些人的特殊能力，我不太推薦你們兩個人繼續行動，太危險了。你們需要我們的支援嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，他們的源石技藝雖然厲害，但戰鬥起來全無章法。我知道該如何保全自身，更不用說還有卡提布在旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":true,"text":"……有事就聯絡我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁耶，他們散得差不多了，我們該動身了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛攀到高處觀察了一下子，對情況有了大致的瞭解。這裡似乎可以簡單地分為三個部分：外圍，居民區，以及最核心的那棟樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那棟樓周圍總有些帶“魔杖”的傢伙守著，想必是有些重要的人物或者東西在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正是要避開那裡的，是什麼不重要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那從居民區繞行？沒看到有人裝備武器，似乎是條安全的出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許更危險也說不定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，有道理……這個世界已經不能用常理來推斷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇——嗚哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"寶寶別哭了，爸爸唱歌給你聽喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"疲憊的羽獸，你要飛向何方♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才能觸摸到明天的風向♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只能拼命揮動今日的翅膀♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）終於睡著了，太好了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到在這裡能聽到這樣的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛有什麼從我腳邊跑過去了。好像是老鼠，不，更像是蝸牛……太黑了，看不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡似乎是他們堆放垃圾的地方，怪不得沒什麼人來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是出去的路了，你該慶幸這個臭氣燻天的地方沒什麼人願意靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵襲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是從那邊的窗子裡透出來的光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們為什麼要在自己家裡做這種事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"厲害，親愛的！我半天都搞不定這隻亂跑的羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在它昏過去了，我們動手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不不不，它又要醒來了，早就說了這種源石技藝根本不適合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（響亮的羽獸鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不不不，她又要醒來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"右邊窗內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（非常響亮的嬰兒啼哭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看來這裡的源石技藝也不是萬能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看外牆上的彩色塑膠板，只有真把這裡當成家的人，才會有心情做這種沒有實用價值的裝飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊的塗鴉也一樣，有不少風景、人像和純裝飾性的東西，看得出來不是隨手塗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得這水準可不低，每一幅裡面都有個故事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們、你們怎麼在這裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，小朋友，我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先冷靜下，那位先生說的事情不是我們做的……這應該是場誤會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我、我也不知道，你們救了我，但是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有任何惡意……你清楚的，小朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這條巷子後向右轉。雖然左邊看起來沒什麼人，但是老爹心煩了會去那裡抽煙，你們有可能會碰上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來丟垃圾，什麼都沒看見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）卡提布，我們該走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
